Parallax (异观) is a Rust reimplementation derived from the AetherSwap / Steam-Alpha workflow.
Original project: https://github.com/VexedWilosn/AetherSwap
User adaptation: https://github.com/Singularity-Ye/Steam-Alpha
The SteamDT protocol shape and indicative wallet conversion were ported from those GPL-3.0 sources.
This repository is distributed under GPL-3.0-only. See LICENSE.
No user credentials, original databases, or private configuration are included.
